WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.904
Mom: It’s time for your nap, Lilly.

2
00:00:07.905 --> 00:00:13.125
Lilly: No, no! No

3
00:00:13.126 --> 00:00:22.819
nap! Mom: Silly, Lilly. It’s nap

4
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:28.214
time. Mom: Your blanket is

5
00:00:28.215 --> 00:00:33.320
soft. Your eyes are heavy.

6
00:00:33.321 --> 00:00:39.302
Close your eyes and dream. Lucky:

7
00:00:39.303 --> 00:00:45.656
Woof! Woof! Woof!

8
00:00:45.657 --> 00:00:49.566
Lilly: Whaa!

9
00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:55.635
Mom: Sam!

10
00:00:55.636 --> 00:00:59.629
Sam: Lucky, what are you doing?

11
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:03.370
Mom: You can’t bark in Lilly's room!

12
00:01:03.371 --> 00:01:09.679
Lilly needs her nap.

13
00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:13.241
Lucky: Woof! Woof! Woof!

14
00:01:13.242 --> 00:01:17.611
Lilly: Whaa!

15
00:01:17.612 --> 00:01:23.236
Sam: Lucky, please stop!

16
00:01:23.237 --> 00:01:27.770
Mom: Sam, Lucky needs to stop. Now.

17
00:01:27.771 --> 00:01:34.443
Sam: I’m trying,

18
00:01:34.444 --> 00:01:42.511
Mom. But he won’t listen.

19
00:01:42.512 --> 00:01:46.230
Mom: He’s just barking at nothing.

20
00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:54.235
There’s nothing out that window. Mom:

21
00:01:54.236 --> 00:01:57.108
Lilly needs to nap.

22
00:01:57.109 --> 00:02:00.181
Lucky: Woof! Woof! Woof!

23
00:02:00.182 --> 00:02:05.638
Mom: That’s it! You two have to go outside.

24
00:02:05.639 --> 00:02:12.685
Sam: Outside? But it’s cold outside.

25
00:02:12.686 --> 00:02:20.253
Mom: You and Lucky both have warm

26
00:02:20.254 --> 00:02:39.779
coats. Put them on and go!

